sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User
  participant UI as voice_live.js
  participant Runtime as voice/runtime.js
  participant API as FastAPI voice_router.py
  participant Gemini as Gemini Live WebSocket
  participant Tools as /api/tools/execute
  participant Verify as /api/voice/verify-current-fact
  participant History as onChatSync / chat persistence

  User->>UI: Tap Voice
  UI->>UI: Show overlay: connecting
  UI->>Runtime: startSession(callbacks, auth, App Check)
  Runtime->>Runtime: getUserMedia + AudioContext + Worklet
  Runtime->>API: GET /api/voice/token
  API->>API: Auth + rate limit + idempotency + quota reserve
  API->>Gemini: Create one-use ephemeral auth token (server key)
  Gemini-->>API: token name + expiry
  API-->>Runtime: token + model + websocket_url
  Runtime->>Gemini: WSS ?access_token=ephemeral token
  Gemini-->>Runtime: open
  Runtime->>Gemini: setup(model, AUDIO, Kore, VAD, resumption, transcriptions)
  Gemini-->>Runtime: setupComplete
  Runtime->>Gemini: realtimeInput.text greeting
  Gemini-->>Runtime: modelTurn audio + output transcription
  Runtime->>Runtime: Decode 24 kHz PCM -> queue AudioBufferSource
  Runtime-->>UI: speaking + AI caption + visualizer

  loop Mic frame
    User->>Runtime: microphone PCM frame
    Runtime->>Runtime: resample 16 kHz + RMS + adaptive gate
    alt gate open
      Runtime->>Gemini: realtimeInput.audio PCM
    else gate closed
      Runtime->>Gemini: throttled silence audio
    end
  end

  Gemini-->>Runtime: inputTranscription chunk
  Runtime->>Runtime: mark semantic turn + append continuity + infer emotion
  alt local time request
    Runtime->>Runtime: hold until provider turnComplete
    Runtime->>Runtime: local current_time
    Runtime->>Gemini: internal realtimeInput.text with local result
  else volatile/current fact
    Runtime->>Verify: POST query + auth + App Check
    Verify->>Tools: authenticated web_search registry execution
    Tools-->>Verify: results or failure
    Verify-->>Runtime: verified evidence or cannot verify
    Runtime->>Runtime: hold speculative model audio until yield
  else normal conversation
    Runtime->>Runtime: allow model response path
  end

  Gemini-->>Runtime: toolCall.functionCalls
  alt blocking/local tool
    Runtime->>Tools: POST /api/tools/execute
    Tools-->>Runtime: tool result
    Runtime->>Gemini: toolResponse.functionResponses
  else non-volatile background web search
    Runtime->>Tools: POST /api/tools/execute in background
    Tools-->>Runtime: result
    Runtime->>Gemini: internal realtimeInput.text research update
  end

  Gemini-->>Runtime: modelTurn parts
  Runtime->>Runtime: fact gate check
  alt allowed audio
    Runtime->>Runtime: schedule PCM chunks and update speaking state
    Runtime-->>UI: AI caption + playback state
  else speculative fact audio
    Runtime->>Runtime: drop audio and output transcription
  end

  Gemini-->>Runtime: turnComplete or interrupted
  alt interrupted
    Runtime->>Runtime: 120 ms fade + clear playback queue
    Runtime-->>UI: listening / next user turn
  else turnComplete
    Runtime->>Runtime: release gates + reset turn flags
    Runtime-->>UI: turn complete
  end

  opt GoAway, network, stale response, or socket close
    Gemini-->>Runtime: goAway / close / error
    Runtime->>Runtime: choose resume, reseed, retry, or pause
    Runtime->>API: mint fresh one-use token for new socket
    Runtime->>Gemini: reconnect WSS + setup + optional resume handle
  end

  User->>UI: Stop call / timeout / mic track ends
  UI->>Runtime: stopSession
  Runtime->>Runtime: abort tools, stop tracks, close socket, close AudioContext
  alt not incognito
    UI->>History: persist accumulated user/AI transcripts
  else incognito
    UI->>UI: discard post-call sync
  end

  Note over Runtime,Gemini: Weak boundary A: internal text notices share realtimeInput with user audio.
  Note over Runtime,Verify: Weak boundary B: verification starts from inputTranscription chunks, not an explicit finalized TurnContext.
  Note over Runtime,Tools: Weak boundary C: tool executor contains backend path and browser fallback in one module.
  Note over Runtime: Weak boundary D: one mutable runtime owns capture, transport, turns, tools, playback, recovery, teardown.
